{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\"\n       xmlns:event=\"https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/event\"\n       version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"idle\">\n  <state id=\"idle\">\n    <transition event=\"order\" target=\"done\"\n                event:schema='{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"id\": {\"type\": \"strng\"}}}'/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml090-event-schema-metaschema.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml090-event-schema-metaschema.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":5,"byteOffset":330,"endColumn":86,"endLine":6,"startColumn":81,"startLine":6},"insertedContent":{"text":"string"}}]}],"description":{"text":"use the type `string`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml090-event-schema-metaschema.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":87,"endLine":6,"startColumn":80,"startLine":6}}}],"message":{"markdown":"the inline schema of `<transition>` is not a valid JSON Schema: at `/properties/id/type`: value must be one of 'array', 'boolean', 'integer', 'null', 'number', 'object', 'string'\n\n**Note:** a schema is checked against the metaschema of its dialect and compiled once, so every keyword has a valid value and every `pattern` is a valid regular expression\n\n**Help:** did you mean `string`?\n\n**Spec:** JSON Schema 2020-12 Validation","text":"the inline schema of `<transition>` is not a valid JSON Schema: at `/properties/id/type`: value must be one of 'array', 'boolean', 'integer', 'null', 'number', 'object', 'string'"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":336,"start":329},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML090"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"the compiler checks a schema against the metaschema of its dialect and compiles it once before embedding it, so every keyword has a valid value and every `pattern` is a valid regular expression; the message names the offending location"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: correct the keyword at the named location.\n\nSpecification: JSON Schema 2020-12 Validation\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML090` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/json-schema-validation","id":"SCXML090","name":"SCXML090","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an `event:schema` is not a valid JSON Schema"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}